{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09181","headline":"期卢嵩枉书称日暮无马不赴以诗答 · 韦应物","name":"期卢嵩枉书称日暮无马不赴以诗答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳期不可失，终愿枉衡门。\n南陌人犹度，西林日未昏。\n庭前空倚杖，花里独留罇。\n莫道无来驾，知君有短辕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}